    <script type="application/ld+json">{"@context": "https://schema.org", "@type": "FAQPage", "mainEntity": [{"@type": "Question", "name": "How much does WhatsApp chatbot development cost for D2C, B2C, B2B, and services across India + GCC + International?", "acceptedAnswer": {"@type": "Answer", "text": "4 transparent tiers: <strong>Starter Rs 45,000 setup + Rs 12,000/mo</strong> (solo/small brands, &lt;500 conv/mo), <strong>Business Rs 85,000 + Rs 22,000/mo</strong> (500-3K conv/mo + basic integrations), <strong>Growth Rs 1,75,000 + Rs 40,000/mo</strong> (3K-15K conv/mo + payments + agent team), <strong>Enterprise Rs 3,50,000+ + Rs 80,000/mo</strong> (15K+ conv/mo + custom AI + multi-country). Meta conversation charges (Rs 0.11-0.78/conv depending on category) pass through at zero markup."}}, {"@type": "Question", "name": "What is included in every package for D2C, B2C, B2B, and services across India + GCC + International?", "acceptedAnswer": {"@type": "Answer", "text": "Every tier includes: (1) WABA (WhatsApp Business Account) verification via Facebook Business Manager, (2) display-name approval, (3) phone-number claim + verification, (4) Meta template pre-approval, (5) bot flow design + build + deployment, (6) basic analytics dashboard (conversation volume + open rate + response rate + conversion), (7) template management, (8) our WhatsApp Business API platform subscription (bundled — no separate invoice). Higher tiers add CRM/payment/catalog integrations + AI + more flows."}}, {"@type": "Question", "name": "How long does WhatsApp chatbot development take for D2C, B2C, B2B, and services across India + GCC + International?", "acceptedAnswer": {"@type": "Answer", "text": "5-phase timeline: Week 1 = discovery + WABA setup starts. Week 2 = display-name approval + phone verification + template pre-approvals. Week 3-4 = bot flow design + build + integrations + testing with 20-30 sample conversations. Week 5 = go-live + team training + 30-day tuning window. Total 4-6 weeks for Starter/Business, 6-10 weeks for Growth/Enterprise (more integrations)."}}, {"@type": "Question", "name": "How do you verify our WhatsApp number for D2C, B2C, B2B, and services across India + GCC + International?", "acceptedAnswer": {"@type": "Answer", "text": "We handle every Meta interaction on your behalf: (1) Facebook Business Manager verification (business documents + legal entity proof), (2) WABA creation + phone-number claim, (3) display-name approval (Meta reviews for compliance), (4) template message pre-approval (marketing + utility + service categories), (5) two-factor auth setup + admin roles. Typical verification timeline 5-10 business days. You maintain full ownership of the WhatsApp account."}}, {"@type": "Question", "name": "What are Meta's per-conversation charges for D2C, B2C, B2B, and services across India + GCC + International?", "acceptedAnswer": {"@type": "Answer", "text": "Meta bills you directly per 'conversation window' (24-hour session, category-dependent, India rates 2026): <strong>Marketing conversations</strong> ~Rs 0.78/conv (promotional broadcasts), <strong>Utility conversations</strong> ~Rs 0.11/conv (order updates, alerts), <strong>Authentication conversations</strong> ~Rs 0.11/conv (OTP delivery), <strong>Service conversations</strong> FREE (customer-initiated, 24hr window — Nov 2024 update). GCC rates 3-5x higher in USD/SAR/AED. We pass Meta charges through at zero markup."}}, {"@type": "Question", "name": "Can we integrate WhatsApp chatbot with our CRM for D2C, B2C, B2B, and services across India + GCC + International?", "acceptedAnswer": {"@type": "Answer", "text": "Yes at Business tier and above. Supported CRMs: Zoho CRM (native), HubSpot (native), Salesforce (native), LeadSquared (native), Freshdesk + Zendesk (support), custom REST API + webhook (for in-house CRMs). Two-way sync: leads captured in chat auto-created as CRM contact + conversation logs + lifecycle updates + workflow triggers. Setup 3-7 business days depending on CRM."}}, {"@type": "Question", "name": "Can WhatsApp chatbot accept payments for D2C, B2C, B2B, and services across India + GCC + International?", "acceptedAnswer": {"@type": "Answer", "text": "Yes at Growth tier and above. Payment gateways supported: Razorpay, Cashfree, PayU (India), Stripe (international), native UPI (India). Payment flow: (1) bot generates payment link mid-conversation, (2) user clicks + pays via UPI/card/wallet, (3) bot receives webhook confirmation, (4) bot sends confirmation + digital receipt. Supported for one-time payments, EMI, subscriptions, refunds."}}, {"@type": "Question", "name": "Do you build AI-powered WhatsApp chatbots for D2C, B2C, B2B, and services across India + GCC + International?", "acceptedAnswer": {"@type": "Answer", "text": "Yes at Growth + Enterprise tiers. AI options: (1) GPT-4/GPT-4o powered responder with your knowledge base fine-tuning, (2) Claude Sonnet/Opus for complex reasoning + longer context, (3) Google Gemini for multimodal (image + text), (4) intent detection + NLU for smart routing between rule-based flows + AI. AI conversations cost Rs 3-15 per exchange (LLM API pass-through, no markup). Bilingual + multilingual AI supported."}}, {"@type": "Question", "name": "How do we prevent spam + get approved by Meta for D2C, B2C, B2B, and services across India + GCC + International?", "acceptedAnswer": {"@type": "Answer", "text": "Meta approval + non-suspension requires: (1) legitimate business + verifiable documents, (2) opt-in-only broadcast lists (never scraped/purchased numbers), (3) template messages that follow Meta content policy (no promotional-in-utility templates), (4) response rate above Meta's threshold, (5) low block-rate + report-rate from recipients. We build every account with these guardrails from day 1 + monitor quality rating monthly."}}, {"@type": "Question", "name": "Can we get the green-tick verified badge for D2C, B2C, B2B, and services across India + GCC + International?", "acceptedAnswer": {"@type": "Answer", "text": "Yes — we handle the application at Enterprise tier + as an add-on (Rs 25,000 one-time) at other tiers. Green tick criteria (as of 2026): notable brand with Wikipedia presence + significant press coverage + high organic search volume. Meta approves 20-40% of applications on first submission. No guarantee — we prep the strongest case + resubmit if rejected."}}, {"@type": "Question", "name": "How is WhatsApp chatbot better than app or website for D2C, B2C, B2B, and services across India + GCC + International?", "acceptedAnswer": {"@type": "Answer", "text": "Numbers speak: <strong>WhatsApp open rate 70-90%</strong> (vs email 15-25%), <strong>response rate 45-60%</strong> (vs email 3-8%), <strong>zero app install</strong> (2.5B users already have WhatsApp), <strong>bookmarkable conversation history</strong>, <strong>no login/password</strong> (phone-verified once), <strong>24/7 automated + human handoff seamless</strong>. Best for: repeat interactions, high-frequency touches, customer support, transactional confirmations, bookings, payment collection."}}, {"@type": "Question", "name": "How do we get started with WhatsApp chatbot for D2C, B2C, B2B, and services across India + GCC + International?", "acceptedAnswer": {"@type": "Answer", "text": "Two ways: (1) Fill the package form on this page — we respond within 24 hours with scoped proposal + call slot. (2) <a href=\"https://calendly.com/itdgrowthlabs-info/30min\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Book a free 30-min Calendly consultation</a> directly. We audit your use case (business automation), scope the bot, share fixed-price proposal within 48 hours. First bots go live within 4-6 weeks of contract."}}]}</script>
