        <div class="wa-faq">
          <div class="wa-faq-item"><h3>1. How much does WhatsApp chatbot development cost for D2C, B2C, B2B, and services across India + GCC + International?</h3><div>4 transparent tiers: <strong>Starter Rs 45,000 setup + Rs 12,000/mo</strong> (solo/small brands, &lt;500 conv/mo), <strong>Business Rs 85,000 + Rs 22,000/mo</strong> (500-3K conv/mo + basic integrations), <strong>Growth Rs 1,75,000 + Rs 40,000/mo</strong> (3K-15K conv/mo + payments + agent team), <strong>Enterprise Rs 3,50,000+ + Rs 80,000/mo</strong> (15K+ conv/mo + custom AI + multi-country). Meta conversation charges (Rs 0.11-0.78/conv depending on category) pass through at zero markup.</div></div>
          <div class="wa-faq-item"><h3>2. What is included in every package for D2C, B2C, B2B, and services across India + GCC + International?</h3><div>Every tier includes: (1) WABA (WhatsApp Business Account) verification via Facebook Business Manager, (2) display-name approval, (3) phone-number claim + verification, (4) Meta template pre-approval, (5) bot flow design + build + deployment, (6) basic analytics dashboard (conversation volume + open rate + response rate + conversion), (7) template management, (8) our WhatsApp Business API platform subscription (bundled — no separate invoice). Higher tiers add CRM/payment/catalog integrations + AI + more flows.</div></div>
          <div class="wa-faq-item"><h3>3. How long does WhatsApp chatbot development take for D2C, B2C, B2B, and services across India + GCC + International?</h3><div>5-phase timeline: Week 1 = discovery + WABA setup starts. Week 2 = display-name approval + phone verification + template pre-approvals. Week 3-4 = bot flow design + build + integrations + testing with 20-30 sample conversations. Week 5 = go-live + team training + 30-day tuning window. Total 4-6 weeks for Starter/Business, 6-10 weeks for Growth/Enterprise (more integrations).</div></div>
          <div class="wa-faq-item"><h3>4. How do you verify our WhatsApp number for D2C, B2C, B2B, and services across India + GCC + International?</h3><div>We handle every Meta interaction on your behalf: (1) Facebook Business Manager verification (business documents + legal entity proof), (2) WABA creation + phone-number claim, (3) display-name approval (Meta reviews for compliance), (4) template message pre-approval (marketing + utility + service categories), (5) two-factor auth setup + admin roles. Typical verification timeline 5-10 business days. You maintain full ownership of the WhatsApp account.</div></div>
          <div class="wa-faq-item"><h3>5. What are Meta&#x27;s per-conversation charges for D2C, B2C, B2B, and services across India + GCC + International?</h3><div>Meta bills you directly per 'conversation window' (24-hour session, category-dependent, India rates 2026): <strong>Marketing conversations</strong> ~Rs 0.78/conv (promotional broadcasts), <strong>Utility conversations</strong> ~Rs 0.11/conv (order updates, alerts), <strong>Authentication conversations</strong> ~Rs 0.11/conv (OTP delivery), <strong>Service conversations</strong> FREE (customer-initiated, 24hr window — Nov 2024 update). GCC rates 3-5x higher in USD/SAR/AED. We pass Meta charges through at zero markup.</div></div>
          <div class="wa-faq-item"><h3>6. Can we integrate WhatsApp chatbot with our CRM for D2C, B2C, B2B, and services across India + GCC + International?</h3><div>Yes at Business tier and above. Supported CRMs: Zoho CRM (native), HubSpot (native), Salesforce (native), LeadSquared (native), Freshdesk + Zendesk (support), custom REST API + webhook (for in-house CRMs). Two-way sync: leads captured in chat auto-created as CRM contact + conversation logs + lifecycle updates + workflow triggers. Setup 3-7 business days depending on CRM.</div></div>
          <div class="wa-faq-item"><h3>7. Can WhatsApp chatbot accept payments for D2C, B2C, B2B, and services across India + GCC + International?</h3><div>Yes at Growth tier and above. Payment gateways supported: Razorpay, Cashfree, PayU (India), Stripe (international), native UPI (India). Payment flow: (1) bot generates payment link mid-conversation, (2) user clicks + pays via UPI/card/wallet, (3) bot receives webhook confirmation, (4) bot sends confirmation + digital receipt. Supported for one-time payments, EMI, subscriptions, refunds.</div></div>
          <div class="wa-faq-item"><h3>8. Do you build AI-powered WhatsApp chatbots for D2C, B2C, B2B, and services across India + GCC + International?</h3><div>Yes at Growth + Enterprise tiers. AI options: (1) GPT-4/GPT-4o powered responder with your knowledge base fine-tuning, (2) Claude Sonnet/Opus for complex reasoning + longer context, (3) Google Gemini for multimodal (image + text), (4) intent detection + NLU for smart routing between rule-based flows + AI. AI conversations cost Rs 3-15 per exchange (LLM API pass-through, no markup). Bilingual + multilingual AI supported.</div></div>
          <div class="wa-faq-item"><h3>9. How do we prevent spam + get approved by Meta for D2C, B2C, B2B, and services across India + GCC + International?</h3><div>Meta approval + non-suspension requires: (1) legitimate business + verifiable documents, (2) opt-in-only broadcast lists (never scraped/purchased numbers), (3) template messages that follow Meta content policy (no promotional-in-utility templates), (4) response rate above Meta's threshold, (5) low block-rate + report-rate from recipients. We build every account with these guardrails from day 1 + monitor quality rating monthly.</div></div>
          <div class="wa-faq-item"><h3>10. Can we get the green-tick verified badge for D2C, B2C, B2B, and services across India + GCC + International?</h3><div>Yes — we handle the application at Enterprise tier + as an add-on (Rs 25,000 one-time) at other tiers. Green tick criteria (as of 2026): notable brand with Wikipedia presence + significant press coverage + high organic search volume. Meta approves 20-40% of applications on first submission. No guarantee — we prep the strongest case + resubmit if rejected.</div></div>
